# Bytecode from the serial-console drivers (omni-console.py, omni-uboot.py,
# omni-push.py, omni-dd-push.py). Kept here rather than in the root .gitignore
# so that this directory ignores its own artefacts wherever it is merged: all
# the Python in this repository lives in tools/, and one of these .pyc files
# was committed once already.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
